    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Disclaimer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erannorth Renaissance is a <strong>text-heavy game</strong>, with most interactions such as storytelling, exploration, and dialogue presented through detailed text. If you enjoy choose-your-own-adventure or gamebook-style experiences, this game is a great fit. <i>If you're unsure, I recommend trying the free demo before purchasing to see if the style suits you.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erannorth Renaissance is a story-driven RPG, where you create your own hero, build a party, and make choices that shape your journey. Set in an open-world, it mixes text-based storytelling with turn-based combat, deep customization, and the freedom to play your way.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Hero</strong><br>Jump right into the action with a pre-built character or create your own. Your origin story is only the beginning. Every choice you make shapes your unique journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter</strong><br>Face ancient vampires or become one. Feed on the innocent or become their champion. Pick pockets, blackmail rivals, attack adventurers, or make the world a safer place by ridding it of supernatural threats and bandits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Dynamic World</strong><br>Step into a living, breathing world that changes with or without you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Interactions</strong><br>Meet and interact with hundreds of NPCs, each with their own personality and story. Form friendships, rivalries, or even romance partners through an optional dating system.\u00a0Your romance settings let you tailor the experience to your preferences. You can disable romance entirely, keep things light with casual flirting, or allow more explicit interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Tactical Combat</strong><br>Engage in strategic battles on a hex-based grid. Combat is approachable for newcomers yet deep enough to challenge seasoned players. You can change the difficulty at any time to make future encounters easier or harder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blade and Spell at Your Fingertips</strong><br>Master powerful weapons and magical abilities to dominate your battles. As you progress, unlock new skills and perks to shape your hero into a legend of your own making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Way</strong><br>Enjoy easy-to-use yet deep customization. Choose your party's gear, skills, and tactics exactly the way you like, making each adventure truly your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radiant Side Contracts</strong><br>Take on endless dynamic quests that react to your actions. These side contracts provide ever-changing opportunities for fame, experience, and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Crafting System</strong><br>Create tools and items using an expansive crafting system. Experiment with ingredients, rare resources, and special tools to discover recipes or learn them from tomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Modding Possibilities</strong><br>Customize and expand the game with full modding support. Whether you are changing character graphics, adding new adventures, or designing entirely new species and combat actions, the built-in tools make modding accessible even if you have never tried it before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In  Erannorth Renaissance, your choices are your legacy.</strong> Will you become a beacon of hope in a fracturing world, or will darker ambitions guide your way? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer the call and shape your destiny.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erannorth Renaissance is a story-driven RPG, where you create your own hero, build a party, and make choices that shape your journey. Set in an open-world, it mixes text-based storytelling with turn-based combat, deep customization, and the freedom to play your way.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Hero</strong><br>Jump right into the action with a pre-built character or create your own. Your origin story is only the beginning. Every choice you make shapes your unique journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter</strong><br>Face ancient vampires or become one. Feed on the innocent or become their champion. Pick pockets, blackmail rivals, attack adventurers, or make the world a safer place by ridding it of supernatural threats and bandits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Dynamic World</strong><br>Step into a living, breathing world that changes with or without you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Interactions</strong><br>Meet and interact with hundreds of NPCs, each with their own personality and story. Form friendships, rivalries, or even romance partners through an optional dating system.\u00a0Your romance settings let you tailor the experience to your preferences. You can disable romance entirely, keep things light with casual flirting, or allow more explicit interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Tactical Combat</strong><br>Engage in strategic battles on a hex-based grid. Combat is approachable for newcomers yet deep enough to challenge seasoned players. You can change the difficulty at any time to make future encounters easier or harder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blade and Spell at Your Fingertips</strong><br>Master powerful weapons and magical abilities to dominate your battles. As you progress, unlock new skills and perks to shape your hero into a legend of your own making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Way</strong><br>Enjoy easy-to-use yet deep customization. Choose your party's gear, skills, and tactics exactly the way you like, making each adventure truly your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radiant Side Contracts</strong><br>Take on endless dynamic quests that react to your actions. These side contracts provide ever-changing opportunities for fame, experience, and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Crafting System</strong><br>Create tools and items using an expansive crafting system. Experiment with ingredients, rare resources, and special tools to discover recipes or learn them from tomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Modding Possibilities</strong><br>Customize and expand the game with full modding support. Whether you are changing character graphics, adding new adventures, or designing entirely new species and combat actions, the built-in tools make modding accessible even if you have never tried it before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In  Erannorth Renaissance, your choices are your legacy.</strong> Will you become a beacon of hope in a fracturing world, or will darker ambitions guide your way? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer the call and shape your destiny.</strong></p>",
